# Welcome to Octaether Ink

Everything is a **block**. Click anywhere in a block to edit it at exactly that spot, and press `Esc` when done. Press `Enter` at the end of a line for a new block, type `/` in an empty line to pick a block type, and drag the ⋮⋮ handle to move a block.

Text holds *italic*, ==highlight==, `code`, [links](https://octaether.com), [[Another Note]], tags like #Guide and #[Start Here], inline math {Math: e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0}, inline chemistry {Chem: 2H_2 + O_2 -> 2H_2O}, and [coloured words]{Color: Accent}. Select text, then right-click or use `Ctrl+B` / `Ctrl+I` to format it.

## Blocks hold blocks

- A list item is a block.
	- Press `Tab` to nest a block under the one above, `Shift+Tab` to bring it back.
	- A nested block can be anything:
		Math: a^2 + b^2 = c^2

Callout {Background: Surface2, Padding: 12px, Radius: 8px}:
	A group keeps related blocks together. {Weight: Bold}

	Code {Language: Python}:
		def rate(k, a, b):
			return k * a * b

## Math

Math: \int_0^\infty e^{-x^2}\,dx = \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}

Math {Numbered: True}:
	\newcommand{\R}{\mathbb{R}}
	f:\R\to\R,\quad f(x) = \sum_{n=0}^{\infty} \frac{x^n}{n!}

Math:
	\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix}^{-1} = \frac{1}{ad - bc}\begin{pmatrix} d & -b \\ -c & a \end{pmatrix}

## Chemistry

Chem:
	\chemfig{@{o}HO^{-}} \qquad \chemfig{@{c}C(-[:100]H)(>[:215]H)(>:[:250]H)@{cb}-@{br}Br}
	Arrow o -> c {Curve: 45}
	Arrow cb -> br {Curve: 70}
	Label c {Side: Below}: backside attack, **inversion** of configuration
	\schemestart \arrow{->[][slow]} \chemfig{HO-[,,,,dashed]@{ts}C(-[2]H)(>[:235]H)(>:[:305]H)-[,,,,dashed]Br} \arrow{->} \chemfig{HO-C(-[:80]H)(>[:-35]H)(>:[:-70]H)} \+ Br^{-} \schemestop
	Label ts {Side: Below, Color: Accent}: transition state

Chem:
	\schemestart \chemfig{*6(=-=-=-)} \arrow{->[Br_2][FeBr_3]} \chemfig{*6(=-=(-Br)-=-)} \+ HBr \schemestop

